        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>The formula for the interior angle of a regular <i>n</i>-sided polygon is $((n-2) \\times 180\u00b0) / n$. For a hexagon ($n=6$), the interior angle is $(4 \\times 180\u00b0) / 6 = <b>120\u00b0</b>$.</p>",
